WEBVTT

00:29:29.488 --> 00:29:32.662
companies fight to the death
and only one is left.

00:29:32.686 --> 00:29:34.934
So what are the key elements?

00:29:34.958 --> 00:29:39.672
One is, well, how hard
does an entrepreneur work

00:29:39.696 --> 00:29:42.669
and get something to run very quickly?

00:29:42.998 --> 00:29:46.061
Take some non-AI examples in the US.

00:29:46.085 --> 00:29:49.141
In the area of food delivery,

00:29:49.165 --> 00:29:53.424
there is Groupon, Yelp,
Grubhub, OpenTable,

00:29:53.448 --> 00:29:55.505
all working in a similar area.

00:29:55.529 --> 00:29:57.537
In China, that's Meituan,

00:29:57.561 --> 00:30:01.149
which is a 30-billion dollar company